<p class="hint center">For planning only. Results depend on the figures you enter and your policy’s terms. They aren’t a quote, an appraisal or legal advice.</p></div></section>
<div class="wrap layout"><article class="prose">
<h2>How depreciation is estimated here</h2>
<p>For each item, depreciation is the item’s age divided by its expected life, multiplied by its replacement cost, up to the cap you choose. Actual cash value is replacement cost minus depreciation. The first payment is ACV minus your deductible.</p>
<h2>Recoverable depreciation</h2>
<p>Many replacement cost policies let you recover the held-back depreciation after repairs are completed, often within a set number of days. Some policies, especially on roofs or older homes, pay actual cash value only. Tick the box if yours does.</p>
<h3>Questions to ask about depreciation</h3>
<ul><li>Was labor depreciated, or only materials?</li><li>Is the age right? Roofs and siding are often older or newer than the estimate assumes.</li><li>Is the expected life realistic for the material?</li></ul><h2>Questions about this tool</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is depreciation the same as wear and tear?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Not exactly. Depreciation is an estimate of lost value due to age and condition. Wear and tear itself usually isn’t covered damage.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can depreciation be disputed in appraisal?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Where the policy and the panel treat actual cash value as part of the amount of loss, depreciation can be part of the discussion.</p></div></details><details><summary>How long do I have to recover depreciation?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Your policy sets the deadline. Check the loss settlement condition, then put the date in the claim timeline builder.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free tools</h2><div class="related"><a href="/policyholder-tools/roof-area-pitch-converter/"><small>Tool</small><span>Roof Area &amp; Pitch Converter</span><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/policyholder-tools/hurricane-deductible-calculator/"><small>Tool</small><span>Hurricane Deductible Calculator</span><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/policyholder-tools/claim-timeline-builder/"><small>Tool</small><span>Claim Timeline Builder</span><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="side"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through</h2><p>A free first conversation. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="box-phone" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ink" href="/request-a-claim-review/">Send claim details</a></div><div class="box"><h2 class="box-t">All claim tools</h2><ul class="box-list"><li><a href="/policyholder-tools/settlement-gap-estimator/">Settlement Gap Estimator<svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/policyholder-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/" aria-current="page">RCV / ACV Holdback Calculator<svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/policyholder-tools/roof-area-pitch-converter/">Roof Area &amp; Pitch Converter<svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24